Package: ConDAdist
Title: Consensus Differential Abundance With Distance-Guided Scoring
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Heekuk", "Park", email = "hp2523@cumc.columbia.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a distance-guided consensus framework for microbiome
    differential abundance analysis. ConDAdist supports single-method
    analysis, multi-method consensus scoring, and optional
    distance-guided evidence integration through the orchestrator
    Go_ConDaDist(). The package standardizes outputs across supported
    DA methods, exports directory-first CSV results, and creates
    bridge files for downstream volcano plotting with the existing Go
    tool family.
